{"id": "Ugyul7qPCtgyoWILW954AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "직접 부르신건가요? 엄청나게 잘 부르시네요.", "published": "2026-09-19T11:16:29", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
